    "parent": "substrate",
    "function": "The shunt capacitor of one transmon: a cross or pad pair whose capacitance to ground C_Σ sets the charging energy E_C and, with the junction's E_J, the qubit frequency and anharmonicity. Its geometry also sets the coupling capacitances to the readout resonator, the neighbours and the drive line; the surface participation of its edges is where most dielectric loss lives.",
